    "Like a negative, every shot keeps the camera’s untouched file. Re-develop it with another camera later, or re-run a new tuning on old photos. Files stay on this iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Like a negative, every shot keeps the camera’s untouched file. Re-develop it with another camera later, or re-run a new tuning on old photos. Files stay on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "像底片一样，每张照片都保留相机未处理的原始文件。之后可以用另一台相机重新冲洗，也能用新的调校重跑旧照片。文件只留在这台 iPhone 上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "像底片一樣，每張照片都保留相機未處理的原始檔。之後可以用另一台相機重新沖洗，也能用新的調校重跑舊照片。檔案只留在這台 iPhone 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
