    "Original frames are the camera files before Pocket CCD renders them. They stay on this iPhone and are used to re-run the camera recipe and check that new tuning still matches real photos." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Original frames are the camera files before Pocket CCD renders them. They stay on this iPhone and are used to re-run the camera recipe and check that new tuning still matches real photos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原片是 Pocket CCD 渲染之前的相机文件，只留在这台 iPhone 上，用来重跑相机配方、核对新调参在真实照片上是否依然成立。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原片是 Pocket CCD 渲染之前的相機檔案，只留在這台 iPhone 上，用來重跑相機配方、核對新調參在真實照片上是否依然成立。"
          }
        }
      }
